# The turtle threshold family's wide point (turtle 100, riposte 1): the
# same one-shot read at sample 1,500 as evolve1-g4m2-turtle85r, latching
# whenever the strongest rival's worth is at or above ours at the window
# -- every match the corpus reads as behind at all, including the ones
# the champion goes on to win -- with the riposte counter-punch behind
# the hold. Priced beside turtle70r so the threshold's shape is read on
# one bar rather than assumed from the 85 point turtlebar192 prices; if
# the hold costs wins on the seeds the champion was winning anyway, this
# is the arm that shows it. Every other knob and every goals slot is the
# champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-turtle100r
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
